{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the battle to save a beautiful planet from an overwhelming infestation in this demo. Get a hands-on look at some of the characters, unlocks, meta progression, and squad upgrades in development for the upcoming release. Play one level on normal difficulty and try out holding reinforcement spots to add up to three characters to your squad. Earn unlocks and meta progression across multiple runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Playable Characters - 3 available at start with 2 more to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Ranks for each character to unlock new weapon and ability options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Bosses with unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In run mini-missions to earn powerful bonus rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character and squad upgrades to earn in run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meta progression between runs to improve over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BUGS!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are excited to get your feedback on the demo. Thank you for playing!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Demo Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757220/87ca364b86a3e5516240f10cbde3350ee26227fb.jpg"},{"name":"Chemical Warfare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757220/421d1e742bae514f0521b7a4e20e5229caaf1a92.jpg"},{"name":"Upstanding Citizen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757220/d86b839d352d4775572fd5d98e3bc497e4ff67f6.jpg"},{"name":"Who's the Cockroach Anyways?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757220/b5a04fd1ff508d1cde54a3770036bba6e4244f84.jpg"},{"name":"Pesticide!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst